  "description": "REA McGee are delighted to present this fantastic opportunity to rent a bright and well-presented two-bedroom apartment on Townsend Street, ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin city centre.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, two bedrooms, modern bathroom, fully fitted kitchen, and a spacious open-plan living/dining area. The living space benefits from large windows providing excellent natural light, contemporary flooring and recessed lighting throughout.\n\nThe modern fitted kitchen comes equipped with cooking facilities, fridge, microwave and ample storage. The bathroom is finished in a clean contemporary style and includes a shower.\n\nSituated on Townsend Street, the property enjoys an exceptionally convenient city-centre location, within easy reach of Trinity College, Grand Canal Dock, the IFSC, Pearse Street DART Station and a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities.\n\n",
